# Implementation Plan - Modern Interactive Theme Styling Across All Application Pages

The goal is to implement modern, interactive, and responsive styling across the **entire application** under both White themes (`modern-white`, `nordic-snow`) and Dark themes (`cyber-midnight`, `pure-obsidian`, etc.), removing all remaining hardcoded dark colors (`#0d1117`, `#131920`, `#1e2d3d`, `rgba(13, 17, 28, ...)`) and ensuring high contrast, interactive feedback, and visual polish.

## User Review Required

> [!NOTE]
> All updates use standard CSS variables (`var(--bg-surface)`, `var(--bg-elevated)`, `var(--border)`, `var(--text-primary)`, `var(--accent)`, `var(--card-shadow)`, etc.) defined across all 8 theme palettes. Existing dark theme visuals remain rich and atmospheric, while white themes gain crisp contrast, interactive elevation, and sleek focus states.

